---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Micro & Calorie Tracker — Best Free AI Calorie & Protein Tracker Online" canonical="https://microcalorietracker.com">
  <Navbar currentPage="/" />

  <!-- Hero Band -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white border-b border-[#ebebeb]">
    <!-- Mesh gradient backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 mesh-gradient opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <!-- Eyebrow badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#fafafa] border border-[#ebebeb] text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] mb-6">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#50e3c2] animate-pulse"></span>
        AI-powered nutrition analysis
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-semibold leading-[38px] md:leading-[56px] tracking-[-1.6px] md:tracking-[-2.4px] text-[#171717] max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-2">
        Know exactly<br />what's in<br />your meal.
      </h1>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 flex-wrap mb-5">
        <a href="/about" class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">About</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">Terms</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[18px] text-[#4d4d4d] leading-[28px] mb-10">
        Upload a photo, add dish details,<br />and get instant macros — calories, protein,<br />carbs, fats — plus personalised suggestions<br />to balance your plate.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA row -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
        <a href="#scanner" class="px-5 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#171717] text-white text-[16px] font-medium flex items-center hover:bg-[#333] transition-colors">
          Scan your meal
        </a>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="px-5 h-11 rounded-full bg-white text-[#171717] text-[16px] font-medium flex items-center border border-[#ebebeb] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-colors shadow-card">
          View dashboard
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats strip -->
      <div class="mt-16 flex items-center justify-center gap-8 flex-wrap">
        {[
          { label: 'Nutrients tracked', value: '30+' },
          { label: 'Accuracy', value: '95%' },
          { label: 'Meals analysed', value: '1M+' },
        ].map(s => (
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717]">{s.value}</div>
            <div class="text-[14px] text-[#888888] mt-0.5">{s.label}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Scanner Section -->
  <section id="scanner" class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">

      <!-- Left: Upload + inputs -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] text-[#171717]">Scan your meal.</h2>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4d4d4d]">Upload a photo or drag & drop. Add dish name and weight for precise results.</p>

        <!-- Upload zone -->
        <div
          id="upload-zone"
          class="relative border-2 border-dashed border-[#ebebeb] rounded-[12px] bg-white p-8 text-center cursor-pointer hover:border-[#a1a1a1] transition-colors group shadow-card"
          role="button"
          tabindex="0"
          aria-label="Upload meal photo"
        >
          <input type="file" id="file-input" accept="image/*" class="absolute inset-0 opacity-0 cursor-pointer w-full h-full" />

          <!-- Preview (hidden by default) -->
          <div id="image-preview" class="hidden">
            <img id="preview-img" src="" alt="Meal preview" class="max-h-64 mx-auto rounded-[8px] object-cover shadow-card-md" />
            <button id="remove-image" class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-[#888888] hover:text-[#ee0000] transition-colors">Remove image</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Upload prompt -->
          <div id="upload-prompt">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#fafafa] border border-[#ebebeb] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:bg-[#f5f5f5] transition-colors">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <path d="M10 3v10M6 7l4-4 4 4" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M3 14v1a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-1" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-[#171717]">Drop your meal photo here</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#888888] mt-1">or click to browse — JPG, PNG, WEBP up to 10 MB</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dish name + weight -->
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label for="dish-name" class="block text-[13px] font-medium text-[#171717] mb-1.5">Dish name <span class="text-[#888888] font-normal">(optional)</span></label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="dish-name"
              placeholder="e.g. Chicken biryani"
              class="w-full h-10 px-3 rounded-[6px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[14px] text-[#171717] placeholder:text-[#888888] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#a1a1a1] transition-colors"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="meal-weight" class="block text-[13px] font-medium text-[#171717] mb-1.5">Approx. weight <span class="text-[#888888] font-normal">(grams)</span></label>
            <input
              type="number"
              id="meal-weight"
              placeholder="e.g. 350"
              min="1"
              max="5000"
              class="w-full h-10 px-3 rounded-[6px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[14px] text-[#171717] placeholder:text-[#888888] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#a1a1a1] transition-colors"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Profile quick-fill (if not set) -->
        <div id="profile-quick" class="rounded-[8px] bg-[#fafafa] border border-[#ebebeb] p-4 space-y-3">
          <p class="text-[13px] font-medium text-[#171717]">Your profile <span class="text-[#888888] font-normal">— used for personalised suggestions</span></p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div>
              <label for="quick-age" class="block text-[12px] text-[#888888] mb-1">Age</label>
              <input type="number" id="quick-age" placeholder="25" min="10" max="100"
                class="w-full h-9 px-2.5 rounded-[6px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[13px] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#a1a1a1]" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="quick-weight" class="block text-[12px] text-[#888888] mb-1">Weight (kg)</label>
              <input type="number" id="quick-weight" placeholder="70" min="20" max="300"
                class="w-full h-9 px-2.5 rounded-[6px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[13px] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#a1a1a1]" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="quick-goal" class="block text-[12px] text-[#888888] mb-1">Goal</label>
              <select id="quick-goal"
                class="w-full h-9 px-2.5 rounded-[6px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[13px] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#a1a1a1]">
                <option value="maintain">Maintain</option>
                <option value="lose">Lose weight</option>
                <option value="gain">Gain muscle</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Meal type selector -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="block text-[13px] font-medium text-[#171717]">Meal type</label>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" id="meal-type-selector">
            <button type="button" data-meal-type="breakfast" class="meal-type-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[13px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[#4d4d4d] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-all">
              🌅 Breakfast
            </button>
            <button type="button" data-meal-type="lunch" class="meal-type-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[13px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[#4d4d4d] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-all">
              ☀️ Lunch
            </button>
            <button type="button" data-meal-type="snack" class="meal-type-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[13px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[#4d4d4d] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-all">
              🍵 Evening Snack
            </button>
            <button type="button" data-meal-type="dinner" class="meal-type-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[13px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[#4d4d4d] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-all">
              🌙 Dinner
            </button>
            <button type="button" data-meal-type="dessert" class="meal-type-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[13px] border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[#4d4d4d] hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-all">
              🍰 Dessert
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Analyse button -->
        <button
          id="analyse-btn"
          class="w-full h-11 rounded-full bg-[#171717] text-white text-[15px] font-medium hover:bg-[#333] transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
        >
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M5 8l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          Analyse meal
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Results panel -->
      <div id="results-panel" class="space-y-4">

        <!-- Empty state -->
        <div id="empty-state" class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] p-12 text-center shadow-card">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#fafafa] border border-[#ebebeb] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
              <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="9" stroke="#ebebeb" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
              <path d="M9 14h10M14 9v10" stroke="#ebebeb" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#171717]">No meal scanned yet.</p>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#888888] mt-1">Upload a photo and click Analyse to see your nutrition breakdown.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Loading state (hidden) -->
        <div id="loading-state" class="hidden rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] p-12 text-center shadow-card">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-[#ebebeb] border-t-[#171717] animate-spin mx-auto mb-4"></div>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4d4d4d]">Analysing your meal...</p>
          <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] mt-1">Scanning & calculating macros</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Results (hidden) -->
        <div id="results-content" class="hidden space-y-4">

          <!-- Meal header -->
          <div class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] p-5 shadow-card">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide">Detected meal</p>
                <h3 id="result-meal-name" class="text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-[#171717] mt-0.5">—</h3>
                <p id="result-weight" class="text-[13px] text-[#888888] mt-0.5"></p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right shrink-0">
                <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888]">Total energy</p>
                <p id="result-calories" class="text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717]">—</p>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#888888]">kcal</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Full Nutrition Report Table (blood-report style) -->
          <div class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] overflow-hidden shadow-card">
            <div class="px-5 py-4 border-b border-[#ebebeb] flex items-center justify-between">
              <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide">Nutrition report</p>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888]">vs. daily reference intake</span>
            </div>
            <!-- Tab switcher -->
            <div class="flex border-b border-[#ebebeb]">
              <button id="tab-macros" onclick="switchTab('macros')"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#171717] border-b-2 border-[#171717] transition-colors">Macros</button>
              <button id="tab-micros" onclick="switchTab('micros')"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[#888888] border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Vitamins & Minerals</button>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <div class="min-w-[500px]">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-5 px-5 py-2 bg-[#fafafa] border-b border-[#ebebeb]">
                  <span class="col-span-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide">Nutrient</span>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide text-right">This meal</span>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide text-right">Daily ref.</span>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide text-right">Status</span>
                </div>
                <div id="nutrition-table-macros" class="divide-y divide-[#ebebeb]"><!-- JS --></div>
                <div id="nutrition-table-micros" class="divide-y divide-[#ebebeb] hidden"><!-- JS --></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>


          <!-- AI Suggestions + Next Meal Ideas -->
          <div class="rounded-[12px] bg-[#171717] p-5 shadow-card-lg">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#50e3c2] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                  <path d="M2 5l2 2 4-4" stroke="#171717" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#50e3c2] uppercase tracking-wide">AI suggestions</p>
            </div>
            <div id="suggestions-list" class="space-y-2 mb-5"><!-- JS --></div>

            <!-- Next meal ideas -->
            <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4">
              <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Suggested next meal</p>
              <div id="next-meal-ideas" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><!-- JS --></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Daily goal progress -->
          <div class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] p-5 shadow-card">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide">Today's running total</p>
              <span id="meals-logged-count" class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888]"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="daily-progress" class="space-y-3"><!-- JS --></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Today's meals timeline -->
          <div class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] overflow-hidden shadow-card">
            <div class="px-5 py-4 border-b border-[#ebebeb] flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide">Today's meals</p>
                <p id="timeline-date" class="text-[11px] text-[#888888] mt-0.5"></p>
              </div>
              <span id="timeline-total-cal" class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#171717]"></span>
            </div>
            <div id="meals-timeline" class="divide-y divide-[#ebebeb]"><!-- JS --></div>
            <div id="meals-timeline-empty" class="hidden px-5 py-8 text-center">
              <p class="text-[13px] text-[#888888]">No meals logged yet today.</p>
              <p class="text-[12px] text-[#888888] mt-1">Scan a meal above to start tracking.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Day summary bar -->
            <div id="day-summary-bar" class="hidden border-t border-[#ebebeb] px-5 py-4 bg-[#fafafa]">
              <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Day summary</p>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3" id="day-summary-macros"><!-- JS --></div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features band -->
  <section class="bg-white border-t border-[#ebebeb] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717] mb-4">
          More than a calorie counter.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4d4d4d] leading-[26px] w-full">
          We track the full picture — every vitamin, mineral, and macro — so you can make smarter food choices. Get comprehensive nutrition insights that go beyond just calories.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7" stroke="#007cf0" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="#007cf0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`,
            title: 'Instant AI analysis',
            desc: 'Get instant macro & micronutrient breakdown from a single photo in under 3 seconds.',
          },
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="14" height="14" rx="3" stroke="#7928ca" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M7 10h6M10 7v6" stroke="#7928ca" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>`,
            title: '30+ nutrients tracked',
            desc: 'Calories, protein, carbs, fats, fibre, vitamins A–K, iron, calcium, zinc and more.',
          },
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10 3c-3.866 0-7 3.134-7 7s3.134 7 7 7 7-3.134 7-7" stroke="#ff0080" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M14 3l3 3-3 3" stroke="#ff0080" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`,
            title: 'Personalised suggestions',
            desc: 'Based on your age, weight and goal, we recommend what to add to balance your plate.',
          },
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 14l4-4 3 3 4-5 3 3" stroke="#50e3c2" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/></svg>`,
            title: 'Daily goal tracking',
            desc: 'See how each meal contributes to your daily calorie and macro targets at a glance.',
          },
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7" stroke="#f5a623" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M10 7v3l2 2" stroke="#f5a623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>`,
            title: 'Meal history',
            desc: 'Every scan is saved to your dashboard. Review weekly trends and spot nutritional gaps.',
          },
          {
            icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10h12M10 4l6 6-6 6" stroke="#171717" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`,
            title: 'Weight correction',
            desc: 'Enter the actual weight of your meal to get exact gram-level nutrient calculations.',
          },
        ].map(f => (
          <div class="rounded-[8px] bg-[#fafafa] border border-[#ebebeb] p-6 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-card transition-all">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-[8px] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-card" set:html={f.icon}></div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px] text-[#171717] mb-1.5">{f.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4d4d4d] leading-[20px]">{f.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="bg-white border-t border-[#ebebeb] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717] mb-4">Frequently asked questions.</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4d4d4d] leading-[26px]">Get answers to common questions about using a calorie tracker for better nutrition.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 w-full">
        {[
          {
            q: 'How does a calorie tracker work?',
            a: 'A calorie tracker works by estimating the energy content of the food you eat. With our AI-powered tool, you simply upload a photo of your meal and optionally enter the dish name and weight. The system cross-references a comprehensive nutrition database to calculate calories, protein, carbs, fats, fibre, and micronutrients. It then compares your intake against daily reference values and personal goals, giving you a complete nutritional breakdown in seconds. No manual logging or barcode scanning required.',
          },
          {
            q: 'Does a calorie tracker actually work?',
            a: 'Yes — calorie tracking is one of the most effective strategies for weight management and nutritional awareness. Studies show that people who consistently track their food intake are more likely to reach their health goals. Our AI calorie tracker makes this easier by eliminating the guesswork: just upload a photo and get instant, accurate macro and micronutrient data. When combined with personalised goal setting, tracking creates accountability and reveals patterns in your eating habits that you might otherwise miss.',
          },
          {
            q: 'How to safely track calories?',
            a: 'Safe calorie tracking means focusing on nutrient quality, not just hitting a number. Use a tracker that provides complete macro and micronutrient data so you can ensure you are getting enough protein, fibre, vitamins, and minerals. Avoid extreme calorie restrictions — a deficit of 300–500 calories below maintenance is generally considered safe for weight loss. Always listen to your body and consult a healthcare professional before starting any diet. Use estimates as guidance rather than absolute rules, and prioritise whole, nutrient-dense foods.',
          },
          {
            q: 'When to stop tracking calories?',
            a: 'You can stop tracking calories when you have developed a solid understanding of portion sizes and nutritional needs, and feel confident maintaining your weight without external tools. Many people track for 4–8 weeks to build awareness, then transition to occasional check-ins. You should also stop if tracking becomes obsessive or negatively impacts your mental health. The goal of a calorie tracker is to educate and empower, not to create anxiety. Use it as a learning tool and pause whenever you need a break.',
          },
          {
            q: 'How accurate is the AI model analysis?',
